# API Kuralları

Önce oku: `docs/08_API/API_SPECIFICATION.md`, `docs/06_BACKEND/`, `docs/07_DATABASE/`

## Onaylı stack

- **Base:** `/api/v1` — prod `https://api.gmrlog.com/v1`, dev `http://localhost:4000/api/v1`
- **Auth:** JWT Bearer + refresh rotation; OAuth (Google, Steam, Discord, Apple)
- **Realtime:** Socket.IO + Redis adapter — `docs/06_BACKEND/REALTIME_ARCHITECTURE.md`
- Event naming: `domain:event` (e.g. `message:new`, `feed:update`, `notification:new`)
- Payload: `{ event, timestamp, payload }`; JWT required for private events
- Namespaces: `/`, `/feed`, `/messages`, `/notifications`, `/developers`, `/admin`
- Rooms: `user:{id}`, `conversation:{id}`, `game:{id}`, etc.
- **Client:** `packages/api` (generated from OpenAPI)

## Response format

Success: `{ success: true, data, meta?, pagination? }`
Error: `{ success: false, error: { code, message, status, requestId, timestamp }, fieldErrors? }`

Detay: `docs/08_API/ERROR_CODES.md` — tüm domain error code'ları

## Pagination & queries

- Cursor: `?cursor=&limit=20` (max 100)
- Sort/filter per `API_SPECIFICATION.md`

## Client error handling

- 401 → login redirect | 403 → permission screen | 404 → not found
- 422 → highlight fields | 429 → retry timer (+ `Retry-After`)
- 500/503 → generic error / retry
- Backend stable codes; client localizes messages

## Davranış

- Yalnızca spec'teki endpoint ve error code'ları kullan
- Server errors internal detail expose etme
- Rate limits uygula (`security.mdc`)
